{{quote||Mission Briefing Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Automatons|Automaton]] [[Optional Objectives|Optional Objective]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''. This is a [[Megafactory]] only objective, in which Helldivers are tasked with destroying nearby statues depicting various Automaton and [[Cyborg Legion|Cyborg]] iconography.

== Objective Steps ==
* Destroy the statues within the Megafactory

== Tactical Information ==
* The statues that need to be destroyed require a demolition force of '''30''' to destroy.
** Explosive Support Weapons, like the [[AC-8 Autocannon]] in APHET mode, and majority of Grenades, like the [[G-12 High Explosive]], are capable of destroying the statues.

